{
  "answer": "The hazard statements related to the product are: H302 (Harmful if swallowed), H315 (Causes skin irritation), H319 (Causes serious eye irritation), H335 (May cause respiratory irritation)",
  "source": "Section 3, Hazard Identification"
}

{
  "answer": "Use appropriate personal protective equipment, avoid breathing vapors, mist or gas, avoid contact with spilled material, ensure adequate ventilation, remove all sources of ignition, use non-sparking tools and equipment.",
  "source": "SECTION 6: ACCIDENTAL RELEASE MEASURES"
}

{
  "answer": "Remove victim to fresh air. If not breathing, give artificial respiration. If breathing is difficult, give oxygen. Consult a physician.",
  "source": "SECTION 4: FIRST AID MEASURE"
}

{
  "answer": "Wash with plenty of soap and water. If skin irritation occurs, get medical advice / attention.",
  "source": "SECTION 4: FIRST AID MEASURE"
}

{
  "answer": "In case of eye contact, flush with plenty of water for at least 15-20 minutes. Remove contact lenses if easy to do so. Continue rinsing. Get medical attention.",
  "source": "SECTION 1: PRODUCT AND COMPANY IDENTIFICATION, SECTION 2: HAZARD(S) IDENTIFICATION"
}

{
  "answer": "IF SWALLOWED: Call a POISON CENTER or doctor / physician immediately. Rinse mouth.",
