{
  "answer": "No known hazardous reactions are described, but there is a description of other hazards not otherwise classified as 'none known.' Additionally, some ingredients have unknown acute toxicity (20-80% of the mixture), and data on reactivity with other substances or materials is unavailable for several polyalkylene glycol ethers.",
  "source": "SECTION 1: Identification / Classification of the Substance / Mixture, SECTION 3: Composition / Information on Ingredients"
}

{
  "answer": "The odor of the product is described as 'pleasant' in one section, but it's also mentioned that 20-80% of the mixture consists of ingredients of unknown acute toxicity.",
  "source": "SECTION 1: Identification, SECTION 2: HMIS Classification"
}

